[{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03120000_03_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03120000_03_0010","text":"──好，碰头会就到这里吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03120000_03_0020","text":"嗯……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03120000_03_0030","text":"说起来，快到了呢\n那个活动"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03120000_03_0040","text":"是的……\n非常期待……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03120000_03_0050","text":"我也是"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03120000_03_0060","text":"商店街的人们也很期待\n一起加油吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03120000_03_0070","text":"嗯……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03120000_03_0080","text":"凛世会尽自己所能……\n全力以赴……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03120000_03_0090","text":"练习也……\n觉得必须更加努力……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03120000_03_0100","text":"嗯，是啊\n大家一定也是同样的心情"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03120000_03_0110","text":"——啊，对了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03120000_03_0120","text":"那这样的话……有个好东西"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03120000_03_0130","text":"……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03120000_03_0140","text":"你看，鬼面具\n在超市买东西的时候送的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03120000_03_0150","text":"我来当鬼，要练习扔豆子吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03120000_03_0160","text":"……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03120000_03_0170","text":"……呵呵……\n制作人大人……当鬼……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03120000_03_0180","text":"怎么可能……向您扔豆子……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03120000_03_0181","text":"Motion"}]
